1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,722
Right now... you are the tallest you will be all day.

2
00:00:04,342 --> 00:00:09,253
While you slept, the gel discs inside your spine soaked up water like sponges...

3
00:00:09,464 --> 00:00:11,648
stretching you two centimeters taller.

4
00:00:12,235 --> 00:00:16,242
All day, gravity squeezes that water back out, and you shrink.

5
00:00:17,022 --> 00:00:21,500
Astronauts have no gravity. They come home five centimeters taller.

6
00:00:22,031 --> 00:00:25,315
Sleep. Grow. Shrink. Repeat.
